# =============================================================================
# ONI Miserable Mods - .gitignore
# =============================================================================
#
# BRANCH BEHAVIOUR (reminder; not enforced by gitignore):
# - Development: local only, never push. All projects + support files.
#   DEVELOPMENT_BRANCH.txt and project-versions.yaml exist only on dev (branch flag + project status truth).
# - Master: pushed to remote. Only PROMOTED projects + support files.
#   BlankProject, BlankProjectSteamTest, SteamWorkshopUploader, .cursor, scripts, file-management files: never pushed.
# - Scripts live in D:\mcp\oni-serena\scripts (3-2-1 backup); reference solution dir as needed.
#
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit / never push (tooling, branch-specific, local)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.cursor/
.cursorrules
/scripts/
*.ps1
*.bat
all-mods-version.txt
SteamWorkshopUploader/
BlankProjectSteamTest/
BlankProject/
DEV_RULES.txt
UPLOAD_INSTRUCTIONS.md
STEAM_UPLOAD_README.md
**/ORGANIZE_FILES.md
memory-bank/
.claude/
.serena/
/jarvis/

# Encrypted / sensitive
steam_credentials.encrypted
*.vdf

# Indexed reference code (junctions / local paths)
/source/
/prime/
/reference/
.cursor/rules/
.cursor/mcp.json
/mcp.json

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Release folder (master): ignore temp subdirs, track zip artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
release/*/
!release/*.zip

